// The default suite's cases, in the order VirtoolsDevTests runs them without
// arguments (its case table must list the same, VirtoolsDevTests.cpp checks)
// and the CTest tests VirtoolsDev.<case> (tests/CMakeLists.txt reads this
// file). ManagersAfterClearAll stays last: its ClearAll drops the
// level the others use.
